---
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/Base.astro";

const meta = {
	description: "Who am I? What do I do?",
	title: "About Me",
};
---

<PageLayout meta={meta}>
	<h1 class="title mb-12">About Me</h1>
	<div class="prose prose-sm prose-cactus max-w-none">
		<p>
			I am a Research Associate at the National Research Council Canada, working on AI Safety
			projects as part of the Canadian AI Safety Institute. In light of recent events, my thoughts
			on AI Safety.
		</p>
		<p>
			I graduated with a PhD in Computer Science in 2024 from the University of Toronto, where I was
			part of the [Computational Linguistics group](https://www.cs.toronto.edu/compling/),
			supervised by [Graeme Hirst](http://www.cs.toronto.edu/~gh/) and [Frank
			Rudzicz](http://www.cs.toronto.edu/~frank/). My PhD projects focused on modelling variation in
			language use as a function of speaker identity, a research area that falls at the intersection
			of natural language processing, sociolinguistics, and cognitive science (thesis
			[here](https://www.cs.toronto.edu/pub/gh/Vishnubhotla-PhD-thesis-2024.pdf)!).
		</p>
		<p>I like language.</p>
	</div>
</PageLayout>
